[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14341.189, "timestamp": "03:59:01", "text": "比如，“哦，Jo正在直播……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14345.229, "timestamp": "03:59:05", "text": "YouTube。”而且缩略图看起来不错。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14347.91, "timestamp": "03:59:07", "text": "那。就是这样。当我停下来的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14350.189, "timestamp": "03:59:10", "text": "流媒体播放时，它会变回我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14354.55, "timestamp": "03:59:14", "text": "常见的横幅广告。是的。尤其如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14357.75, "timestamp": "03:59:17", "text": "我也需要发那条推文。主要是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14358.67, "timestamp": "03:59:18", "text": "鸣叫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14361.59, "timestamp": "03:59:21", "text": "东西。我想那样做。我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14370.269, "timestamp": "03:59:30", "text": "现在，动态自动推文"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14373.429, "timestamp": "03:59:33", "text": "东西。但这件事，呃，是我的一部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14380.71, "timestamp": "03:59:40", "text": "为了更好地掌控它。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14381.95, "timestamp": "03:59:41", "text": "将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14384.79, "timestamp": "03:59:44", "text": "我会尝试用串流板，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14387.91, "timestamp": "03:59:47", "text": "如果不行，我会使用……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14390.389, "timestamp": "03:59:50", "text": "好用的老式 Leor 板，但我得付钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14393.59, "timestamp": "03:59:53", "text": "因此，我不想为此付费。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14397.51, "timestamp": "03:59:57", "text": "船上的东西又来了，真是太痛苦了。"}]